The OpenDongle hardware source is licensed under the CERN Open Hardware
Licence Version 2 - Weakly Reciprocal in LICENSE.

OpenKeyboard.org independently created the antenna footprint, schematic, and
PCB geometry in these files, informed by the published WCH 2.4 GHz reference
antenna and its functional requirements:

* CH570/lib/OpenDongle.pretty/ANT-F-2-2.4G-0.8MM-FR4-WCH.kicad_mod
* CH592/lib/OpenDongle.pretty/ANT-F-2-2.4G-0.8MM-FR4-WCH.kicad_mod
* The corresponding routed antenna geometry in each OpenDongle PCB

Reference publication: https://github.com/openwch/schpcb_lib

No WCH CAD, footprint, schematic, or artwork file was copied, imported,
converted, or traced. The reference is retained as factual attribution for the
design inspiration; the independently authored OpenKeyboard.org source files
are licensed under CERN-OHL-W-2.0 with the rest of the hardware design.
